        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    weight_x = 0.25\n    weight_y = 0.75\n    std_x = 0.179\n    std_y = 0.062\n    correlation = 0.5\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    portfolio_variance = (\n        (weight_x ** 2 * std_x ** 2)\n        + (weight_y ** 2 * std_y ** 2)\n        + (2 * weight_x * weight_y * correlation * std_x * std_y)\n    )\n    portfolio_standard_deviation = portfolio_variance ** 0.5\n    answer = round(portfolio_standard_deviation * 100, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
